{"id":"u-b4fc8747-3498-493b-84ee-b52847995167","src":"community","title":"4-Day Gym Split","author":"Yasmin C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/8ZMNAu-workout-routine-4-day-gym-split","desc":"A 4-week split that trains your whole body across four focused days, with each muscle group getting a full week to recover. Day 1 is quad-focused legs (squats, Bulgarian split squats, leg press), Day 2 is push (shoulders, chest, triceps), Day 3 is glutes and hamstrings (Romanian deadlifts, hip thrusts, lunges, kickbacks), and Day 4 is pull and core (back, biceps, planks, dead bugs). Two lower-body days put extra emphasis on the glutes and legs. The mix of heavy compound lifts and isolation exercises builds strength and muscle while shaping your physique.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-23T14:17:45.490Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Body - Quads & Glutes","Upper Body - Push","Lower Body - Glutes & Hammies","Upper Body - Pull & Core"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Kickback (Cable)","sets":[{"r":30,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row